{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id32432500"}, "name":{"label":"red letter day"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-07T20:00:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13488517714"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing game but please fix controller support and UI issues"}, "content":{"label":"This game is amazing but it is compromised on mobile. If you are able, get this on computer or consoles. The controls and UI have a lot of issues and if you’ve played on other platforms you will get very frustrated, even with a controller. It also has not been updated to accommodate newer, rounded screens. Parts of the UI are cut off in the corners. There are some helpful options to change and resize the layout but they don’t cover everything. Also, there should be an option to have the controller support match what is on consoles if you have a controller. Inventory management is frustrating with the current options.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
