{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1863005386"}, "name":{"label":"Daisy of Stardew"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-03T08:48:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13470876987"}, "title":{"label":"Best game ever"}, "content":{"label":"I’m nearly 60 and have been a gamer for a long time.  My daughter, who has been playing this game for 10-15 years, let me play a bit on her switch and then I bought the game for $5 as my personal b-day gift.  It’s addicting and fun, and the sweetest game ever.  The hardest part to master was the fishing, but once you become more adept, which takes a few seasons, the green bar gets bigger making fishing easier.  The thing I love the most is how many treasure hunts there are, and the challenges of mining, and monster hunting.  I’ve recently reached the forge in the volcano mines on Ginger Island, and have even managed to find dragon teeth.  My favorite characters are Krobus and Leo.  I stay away from some aspects of the game, but overall it’s a five star.  Love it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-10-15T11:31:53-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
